    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discord !</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832110/extras/fc5d786edd28fb0446b168e2fcc235b6.poster.avif?t=1711044148\" width=582 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832110/extras/fc5d786edd28fb0446b168e2fcc235b6.webm?t=1711044148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832110/extras/fc5d786edd28fb0446b168e2fcc235b6.mp4?t=1711044148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>Fall of the Mist is an innovative deckbuilding card game. Play cards in a strategic order and according to symbol logic to defeat the Order's opponents.<br>Make the most of your hand by combining the effects of Class and Mist cards.<br>Understand the Mist to improve your deck and your equipment and defeat your foes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 200+ cards and power to shape your deck as you wish.<br></li><li> Unique way to play and combo your card.<br></li><li> Solo game with high replay value.<br></li><li> A story driven game</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replay Value</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 different heroes with unique playstyle.<br></li><li> Evolutive narration<br></li><li> Alternative act.<br></li><li> 50+ random events<br></li><li> Alternative Modes and difficulties</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832110/extras/fc5d786edd28fb0446b168e2fcc235b6.poster.avif?t=1711044148\" width=582 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832110/extras/fc5d786edd28fb0446b168e2fcc235b6.webm?t=1711044148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832110/extras/fc5d786edd28fb0446b168e2fcc235b6.mp4?t=1711044148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>Fall of the Mist is an innovative deckbuilding card game. Play cards in a strategic order and according to symbol logic to defeat the Order's opponents.<br>Make the most of your hand by combining the effects of Class and Mist cards.<br>Understand the Mist to improve your deck and your equipment and defeat your foes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 200+ cards and power to shape your deck as you wish.<br></li><li> Unique way to play and combo your card.<br></li><li> Solo game with high replay value.<br></li><li> A story driven game</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replay Value</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 3 different heroes with unique playstyle.<br></li><li> Evolutive narration<br></li><li> Alternative act.<br></li><li> 50+ random events<br></li><li> Alternative Modes and difficulties</li></ul>",
